		<p style="color: #442056;font-family: sans-serif;font-weight: bold;font-size: 14px;"><strong>PLAYERS SELECTED FOR ALL INDIA INTER UNIVERSITY COMPETITION</strong></p>
<ol>
<li style="color: black;font-family: sans-serif;font-size:14px;">Suradkar  Siddheshwar:- (T.Y.B.Com)<br /> He Participated in All India Inter  University Cross- Country Competition as a Representative of Pune University  Team held at M.D.U University Rohtak on 25th to 29th  October 2011.</li>
<li style="color: black;font-family: sans-serif;font-size:14px;">Surve  Avinash:- (S.Y.B.Com)<br /> He has selected for All India Inter  University Boxing Competition as a Representative of Pune University Team held  at Barkatulla University Bhopal on 13th to 23rd December  2011.</li>
</ol>
<p style="color: #442056;font-family: sans-serif;font-size: 14px;font-weight: bold;"><strong>PLAYERS  SELECTED FOR ASHWAMEDH COMPETITION</strong></p>
<ol>
<li style="color: black;font-family: sans-serif;font-size:14px;">Suradkar  Siddheshwar:- (T.Y.B.Com)<br /> He has selected for ASHWAMEDH  Competition as a Representative of Pune University Athletics Team for the event  10,000 M run held at S.R.T University Parbhani.</li>
</ol>
<p style="color: #442056;font-family: sans-serif;font-weight: bold;font-size: 14px;"><br /> <strong>PLAYERS  SELECTED FOR INTER ZONAL COMPETITION</strong><br /> Our College Korfball Team Achieved  Runner up position in Pune District  Inter  Collegiate Korfball Competition. Our Team Defeat the Warwand college,  Rajgurunagar college, Chakan college in this Competition. The following Players  are selected for Inter Zonal Competition.</p>
<ol>
<li style="color: black;font-family: sans-serif;font-size: 14px;">Muluk  Dattatray (M.Com)</li>
<li style="color: black;font-family: sans-serif;font-size: 14px;">Shinde  Rupesh (T.Y.B.Com)</li>
<li style="color: black;font-family: sans-serif;font-size: 14px;">Khandekar  Jayant (M.A)</li>
<li style="color: black;font-family: sans-serif;font-size: 14px;">Surgude  Supriya (T.Y.B.Com)</li>
<li style="color: black;font-family: sans-serif;font-size: 14px;">Londhe  Dipali (T.Y.B.Com)</li>
<li style="color: black;font-family: sans-serif;font-size: 14px;">Gawali  Meenakshi (S.Y.B.A)</li>
</ol>
<p style="color: #442056;font-family: sans-serif;font-size: 14px;font-weight: bold;"><strong>Our College Boxing Team Achieved Runner up  position in Pune District  Inter  Collegiate Boxing Competition. The following Players are selected for Inter  Zonal Competition.</strong></p>
<ul>
<li style="color: black;font-family: sans-serif;font-size: 14px;"> Surve Avinash :- (S.Y.B.Com)<br /> He won a Gold Medal in Pune District Inter  Collegiate Boxing  Competition  and selected for Inter Zonal Competition.</li>
<li style="color: black;font-family: sans-serif;font-size: 14px;">Bhosale Suraj :- (S.Y.B.Com)<br /> He won a Gold Medal in Pune  District Inter Collegiate Boxing Competition and selected for Inter Zonal  Competition. </li>
</ul>
<p style="color: #442056;font-family: sans-serif;font-size: 14px;font-weight: bold;"><strong>The following Players are selected  for Inter Zonal Competition</strong></p>
<ul>
<li style="color: black;font-family: sans-serif;font-size: 14px;">Surgude Supriya :- (T.Y.B.Com)<br /> She has Participated in Inter  Zonal Kabaddi (Girls) Competition organized by Pune University at M.P.College  Pimpri on 22nd &amp; 23rd August 2011 as a representative  of Pune District Kabaddi (Girls) Team. Pune District Kabaddi (Girls) Team  Achieved Second Place In this Competition.</li>
<li style="color: black;font-family: sans-serif;font-size: 14px;">Surgude Supriya :- (T.Y.B.Com)<br /> She has selected for Inter Zonal  Kho-Kho (Girls) Competition as a representative of Pune District Kho-Kho  (Girls) Team.</li>
<li style="color: black;font-family: sans-serif;font-size: 14px;">Suradkar Siddheshwar:- (T.Y.B.Com)<br /> He got First Place in  Pune District Inter Collegiate Cross-  Country  Competition held at Shankarrao  Bhelke College Nasarapur on 30th august 2011.</li>
<li style="color: black;font-family: sans-serif;font-size: 14px;">Muluk Dattatray :- (M.Com) <br /> He has selected for Inter Zonal  Netball Competition as a representative of Pune District Netball Team.</li>
<li style="color: black;font-family: sans-serif;font-size: 14px;">Shinde Rupesh:- (T.Y.B.Com)<br /> He has Participated in Inter Zonal  Handball Competition organized by Pune University at K.T.H.M College  Nashik  on 8th  &amp; 9th October 2011 as a representative of  Pune District Handball Team. Pune District Handball Team Achieved Third  Place In this Competition.</li>
<li style="color: black;font-family: sans-serif;font-size: 14px;">Randhave Mangesh :- (F.Y.B.Com)<br /> He got First Place in Pune District  Inter Collegiate Wrestling Competition held at M.S.K. Kakade college  Someshwarnagar on 1st November 2011. He got Third Place in Inter  Zonal Competition held at M.S.K. Kakade college Someshwarnagar on 4th  &amp; 5th November 2011.</li>
<li style="color: black;font-family: sans-serif;font-size: 14px;">Kalawale Pooja:- (S.Y.B.Sc)<br /> She has Participated in Inter Zonal  Hockey  Competition organized by Pune  University at Polygrass Ground Pimpri  on  4th &amp; 5th November 2011 as a representative of Pune District Hockey (Girls)   Team. Pune District Hockey (Girls) Team  Achieved Third Place In this Competition.</li>
<li style="color: black;font-family: sans-serif;font-size: 14px;">Salunkhe Vikas :- (M.C.S)        <br /> He got First Place in Pune District  Inter Collegiate Shooting  Competition  held at B.J. College Ale on 8th September 2011 and selected for  Inter Zonal Competition.</li>
<li style="color: black;font-family: sans-serif;font-size: 14px;">Suradkar Siddheshwar:- (T.Y.B.Com)<br /> He got First Place in  Pune District Inter Collegiate Athletics  Competition held at Annasaheb Waghire   College Otur on 13th   to 16th Oct 2011.</li>
</ul></td>
